    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just a ghost of who i used to be. spent my whole life building this intellect, this career... and now it's just gone. everything i worked for is a joke. there's nothing left of me except this huge, empty space where my purpose used to be. i dont even know why i'm still bothering to wake up every day.",
